    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "It's time for the big oil companies to lower prices rather than pad your bottom line. It is time to stop your decades-long obstruction of the transition to clean energy, which would provide lower costs for consumers, the cars and trucks we drive, the way we heat our homes and cooler homes.",
