    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95525.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "Well the purpose of this hearing was to hear directly from the big oil CEOs and ask them questions about their skyrocketing profits and to try to elicit some information and answers because we are looking for solutions for the hard-working people we represent back home the small business owners of parents trying to get through the day with their kids you know the long-term solutions are are out there and the medium term solutions are in front of us as well but what could we do to provide some immediate relief that's tough in the middle of Putin's unprovoked war on Ukraine and but also try to dig into are these big oil companies just going to continue stock buybacks and patting their bottom line and I don't know if people asked about their salaries that are tied to profits. We also need to make that plane for the American people.",
