    "turn_text": "Yeah, just in the more short term, I know that there's been a conversation led by Speaker Pelosi in the House to come up with something that the House can coalesce around. And it seems like it's been difficult to come to a consensus. A lot of the ideas, federal gas tax, we've talked about rebates. I know it maybe picked up some steam, but we haven't actually seen any formal endorsement of that from the caucus wide. Where are House Democrats as far as coming up with some legislative solution? Or is there really not an answer?",
